The '''{{zone|Mage Outpost}}''' is an area on the [[Crimson Isle]] bordering {{zone|Scarleton}}.

{{ZoneText|Kill Mages to neutralize your Reputation with the Barbarian Faction.}}

== Location ==
The location features a large outpost with tall towers and scattered fireplaces where [[Fire Mage]]s spawn, and rarely [[Krondor Necromancer]]s.

